<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-12T00:40:54.095Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 00:40:54 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits ambushed army-escorted traders in Zamfara, leaving 22 feared dead, while suspected Fulani bandits killed a vigilante member in Plateau and fled as troops arrived. In Benue, suspected herders attacked communities, killing six and leaving others missing. Nigerian forces killed 25 ISWAP fighters in Borno, and the Sultan warned youths not to support bandits or thuggery. Nigeria condemned the Houthi attack on Saudi King Khalid International Airport that killed 12 and injured over 300. The conflict caused 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxOR216a3MxSVU0ZjNMd21GN1VuUXlrMDZ3S3JFNGI0dF9mU0FnbHU4UVotaktoM3d1V2NJTnp0cVNoaElVZ3g2dDE1Vy1zbFJKR1c3dmwyTzBOZkI0YlBNLVhvcDJhNkZaTV9QSFE4ZmlDdzVTRk9rQzdGLTFrcUdRazNjQV94V0tybVZ0LVc2UWs4Wk9hTVJLOXFGR3dlOU5jLWFBRkZkVDFSUXpDNlc2c2lZUzdWN0VKX0k3bDhkY1JnanZkZUc4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Punch Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQaE1yMnZhbkFCbGlIeUxoOXY2aVR1cjBnbXctU3o5MTB1T251RGZXZmxxTF9KMkd1aWVxakNGUkxYR1prMmJjb1VMRkJ3ZjZXUzlEUk52SHcxeGhJUE5uV1RJRHVyQjA1cFRtb3I3SzFHV2prSkkwYVVqZjJ4Yk1vWWtPeGVBTXRYYmdSZmp6SXFKX2IzWXhiT3BKYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Platform Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxPTVpDNG9zbUtsQnJYd1ZqcHB4RlJSNXg1Mi1kcFJpcmVmTG0tRGVZTFRDQ3RhakYybGxvMmNVRFBqZjhJNnF3akl0amdsZ2JsQ2J6Rk41dUhrWGNwdElETV9OVmpFbnI0bDVBYW02dkJMVTlxRzhpUnZKUVpfRVZ6cnR1RjlpX0Nnc3U1NmpHOWpqM0gwbGhNWUFER3RkYkpmZmtlclNfbFJqajBOQnpVZ0ZaRG05cHlUa2tHNg?oc=5&quot;&gt;FIJ NG&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQeng0ckdpdUpHaEJyZnZzai1nalQ4NGhpeVhORlpoR0VPc3dwaWNuUW1CQ2EtbTZCT1N1TjF4RGJfU3lYbGQ4OVBNSGtoalhNTFgxOXh6QWZ6YWpjNkp0dGhTTDMteEdXcF83NTRfWmVNYk4tdGJYLUYzYjJRQXVlZUE0VkV4Wm16dDZ